{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51026","headline":"咏红芙蓉上宋使（「宋使」二字於此当脱「君」字。宋使君屡见於《禅月集》，《唐刺史考》考定爲宋震。） · 贯休","name":"咏红芙蓉上宋使（「宋使」二字於此当脱「君」字。宋使君屡见於《禅月集》，《唐刺史考》考定爲宋震。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"擘水苞金紫艳浓，乍观疑在水仙宫。\n难驱颜色文章里，合出天人池馆中。\n芬馥静生朱槛腻，动摇微映鹭鸶红。\n临川内史诗相似，摇仰清吟满阁风。\n（见《唐歌诗》残本六册《草木虫鱼类》卷五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}